# Terraform local state / working files
**/.terraform/
**/.terraform.lock.hcl
**/terraform.tfstate
**/terraform.tfstate.backup
**/tfplan

# Real, filled-in values — only the .example templates are meant to be committed.
**/terraform.tfvars
**/backend.hcl

# Generated by the Landing Zone UI (ui/) — real account ids, bucket names,
# CIDRs for whatever an employee filled in, plus its local audit trail.
**/terraform.tfvars.json
ui/audit.log

# Python bytecode cache from running ui/ or scaffolder/
**/__pycache__/

# Note: a workload folder's own .tf files (copied from workload-account-example/
# by ui/ or scaffolder/) are real, meaningful infrastructure-as-code and are
# NOT excluded here — only its tfvars/state/plan/backend.hcl are, via the
# generic patterns above, same as every other environment.
